      "title": "USB HID: Decode protocol field",
      "message": "USB HID: Decode protocol field\n\nAdd a new Protocol field, including value names for decoding. To be\nconsistent with the standard control message structure and all other\ncontrol messages, place it as a child beneath wValue.\n",
